***REMOVED*** ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** Variable overrides — copy to terraform.tfvars and customize
***REMOVED*** ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** Not committed. Set your actual values here.
***REMOVED*** Sensitive values can also be set via TF_VAR_* env vars.
***REMOVED*** All values are normally rendered from Bitwarden by scripts/fetch_vault.sh.
***REMOVED*** ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

***REMOVED*** Base domain name (managed by Porkbun DNS)
domain_name = "your-domain.example.com"

***REMOVED*** SSH connection metadata for the VPS
ssh_user = "your-ssh-user"
ssh_port = 22

***REMOVED*** Primary public IPv4 address of the VPS (used for DNS A records)
vps_ip = "203.0.113.1"

***REMOVED*** Subdomains to create as A records under domain_name
subdomains = ["hermes", "status", "n8n", "auth"]

***REMOVED*** VPS configuration in OVH Manager
vps_display_name = "my-agent"
vps_plan_code    = "REDACTED-PLAN"
vps_os           = "Debian 12"

***REMOVED*** SSH key and image ID must both be set together (OVH API requirement)
ssh_public_key = "ssh-ed25519 AAAA..."
vps_image_id   = "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"

***REMOVED*** S3-compatible Object Storage buckets for Tofu state and restic backups
state_bucket_name  = "my-agent-tofu-state"
backup_bucket_name = "my-agent-backups"

***REMOVED*** S3-compatible Object Storage connection settings
storage_region     = "gra"
storage_endpoint   = "https://s3.gra.io.REDACTED-OVH-DOMAIN"
storage_access_key = "my-access-key"
storage_secret_key = "my-secret-key"
